        {
          "id": 1737742712,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi @martin.r.mathieson ,\nI'm attaching a pcap containing 1 frame with a packet showing the issue. You will need my patch to dissect it successfully. Have a look at \"PDP Information Complete\" IE there.\n\nEven with my patch you will still see stuff like \"GSUP Message Type Unknown\" or \"message Clas IE unknown\" in the dissector tree, but that's expected since it's new messages I'm adding which use existing IEs.\nI plan on submitting improvements to the GSUP dissector later on once we settle those newly added messages in GSUP.\n\nWithout my patch, you will get the following Expert Info (error/Malformed):\n`[Trying to fetch an unsigned integer with length 0]\n\n[gsup_epdg_tunnel_result.pcap.gz](/uploads/624d53154eb5856f91355ea4bdece960/gsup_epdg_tunnel_result.pcap.gz)",
